flowchart TD
  Request[Validated controller request] --> Model[Eloquent model / relationship]
  Model --> Query[Build SQL query or persistence operation]
  Query --> DB[(Relational database)]
  DB --> Result[Rows, inserted ID or constraint result]
  Result --> Model
  Model --> Controller[Controller continues]
  Controller --> Response[Inertia response or redirect]
  Note[Foreign keys and unique constraints enforce relational integrity; they do not implement authorization]:::note
  Result -.-> Note
  classDef note fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b58100,color:#473400;
